      "created_at": "2014-01-05T01:47:29.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It's just over a month since the most recent post on the <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/journals/gtg-business-blog\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">GTG Business Blog</a>. I know that there are multiple good reasons for that blog, and many other things, being quiet for that month. I hope that it'll start up again soon.</p><p>If you're looking for topic suggestions...</p><p>I'd be interested in the reasoning and timing of the move from Kickstarter to DIY pre-orders for Vengence. I think I've seen bits and pieces on this, but would love to see the decision put in the context of the KS experience from the GTG perspective, and thoughts on future releases.</p><p>Hope everyone's 2014 has started well,</p><p>Andrew</p>",
